  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["D", "\[Theta]"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "88e2b40c-f1ef-4bb5-93de-31dbb856c347"],
 " analytically (as we did previously in our Langmuir paper)"
}], "Text",
